    "title": "Full Stack <span class=\"highlight\">Developer</span> Needed for AI-Powered SaaS Platform",
    "description": "We are seeking an experienced Full Stack <span class=\"highlight\">Developer</span> to build and maintain an AI-powered aviation SaaS platform. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in <span class=\"highlight\">React</span> or Next.<span class=\"highlight\">js</span>, Node.<span class=\"highlight\">js</span>, TypeScript, REST APIs, SQL/NoSQL databases, and cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud. You will be responsible for developing scalable frontend and backend applications, integrating aviation data sources and AI/LLM services, building secure APIs, optimizing system performance, and implementing features such as flight operations, aircraft management, maintenance tracking, crew scheduling, and real-time dashboards. Experience with aviation software, flight data integration, GIS/maps, real-time data processing, and modern DevOps practices is a strong advantage. We are looking for someone who writes clean, maintainable code, communicates effectively, and can deliver high-quality solutions for mission-critical aviation applications. Please share your portfolio, GitHub profile, relevant aviation or SaaS project experience, and your availability when applying.",
